    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 316,
        "text": "Hi everyone, thanks for coming. We need to decide today whether to approve the new community garden on the old parking lot. But first, I want to be clear: we don't have all the information yet. The soil test results won't be back until next week. So we're deciding with incomplete evidence. That's the reality.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "40d5a84722b3c69624118aec4371d1cd339ab0278c95bdd029e6848844c17b2e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 326,
        "sourceEnd": 500,
        "text": "Sorry, Maya, can I just check something? You said the soil test results are not back. Does that mean we have no idea about contamination? Or do we have some early indication?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "f04f297e076af4ad89b91662252b86b4e9e608b02fef650ab01b5ff2dfe591ca",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 508,
        "sourceEnd": 653,
        "text": "Good question. We have an early indication from a quick scan. It suggests low risk, but it's not a full test. So we should treat it as uncertain.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "c3a1bc482edc47393d0a4d775eeddbc420538de1d090780ddd3c2e9e59bf580b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 662,
        "sourceEnd": 812,
        "text": "I think we should postpone the decision. If we approve now and the soil is bad, we'll have to close the garden and spend more money. That seems risky.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "bc78f1742a2024113662b74f30ea3d33f6aa11835fc1b160e15b06fb151142a3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 822,
        "sourceEnd": 952,
        "text": "I understand that, Priya. But if we wait, we lose the planting season. The grant money expires in June. So waiting has a cost too.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "6df3e17da495a56ef3c63a64a7856952ab5080082165b451fdf070a9213b7ca8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 960,
        "sourceEnd": 1242,
        "text": "Exactly. So the question is: how do we make a good decision when we can't be sure? I suggest we approve a conditional plan. We say yes to the garden, but only if the full soil test is acceptable. If it's not, we stop. That way we don't lose the season, and we don't take a big risk.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "b0da7ac52316c7249bbb443c09e1c21144a89ee933d6ce02307248a83c4b2a14",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 1251,
        "sourceEnd": 1389,
        "text": "Hmm. That sounds reasonable. But who pays for the full test? And what happens if the test is borderline—not clearly good, not clearly bad?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "3c8abe11fa56db3aa385798a5ed42210d386397a913504be7fa9773aab703fdb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1397,
        "sourceEnd": 1532,
        "text": "The city has agreed to pay for the full test. For borderline results, we ask an independent expert to review. That's in the draft plan.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "9f580cc7ad10fd512c859785ae5defcc2f3da9ff4e8e993756e9c47aa044e15c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 1542,
        "sourceEnd": 1752,
        "text": "OK, I'm starting to agree. But I want to add one thing: we should tell the public exactly what we know and what we don't know. If we pretend we're certain, and then something goes wrong, people will lose trust.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "8e7fceda7d004a1420318062914a093e626ffb7795ec21eb123902350d31bb98",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1760,
        "sourceEnd": 1961,
        "text": "Yes, transparency matters. So the plan includes a public note: 'We are approving this garden with conditions because the evidence is incomplete. We will publish the full test results when they arrive.'",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "63cd7603f7e55ce300828667916f8d7a3e40457c9574c1f5a8f1b950e64472f6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 1970,
        "sourceEnd": 2099,
        "text": "I like that. But I'm still worried about the money. If the test fails, we've already spent money on design. Can we get that back?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "ec671e3dae3c784c0e128927c4256f01ec56e7a3b5a202c0cbc8fc4a1fb71ac8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2107,
        "sourceEnd": 2256,
        "text": "No, design costs are sunk. We can't get them back. But they're small compared to the cost of a bad garden. So the conditional plan still makes sense.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "df5361a3f92e0550e734aae8c74008790edf3e9de6b9ac95ca7c921f94931156",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 2266,
        "sourceEnd": 2402,
        "text": "Wait—did you say the design costs are sunk? I thought the grant covered design. If the grant covered it, then it's not our money, right?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "0b7dca69c5e4c81047797d109382a7961154cb26baaa37339e958cc152f453de",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2410,
        "sourceEnd": 2672,
        "text": "The grant covers design only if we start construction. If we cancel, we pay back the design money. So it's not fully sunk. Sorry, I misspoke. Let me correct that: design costs are recoverable only if we cancel before construction. So they're not completely sunk.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "9c26a5255cbb88f9efa7c259137378f23c339ef20a2017f38cfc6e3c6a6c7fe5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 2681,
        "sourceEnd": 2816,
        "text": "OK, that changes things a little. So if we cancel early, we don't lose the design money. That makes waiting less costly than I thought.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "13ff72e429d585e10ac2cc64597353aaeb4b9d84055d74de2ab460bc81edd170",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 2826,
        "sourceEnd": 3010,
        "text": "Right. But we still lose the season if we wait for the full test. The test takes two weeks. Planting season starts in three weeks. So if we wait, we might still make it—but it's tight.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "22a0afabf8c7799ede2629098ca5320e9b44da5f08348b465d86cb3af5aaca54",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 3018,
        "sourceEnd": 3044,
        "text": "So let's summarize. Option",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "02d67d24dddc2359269f218e5d1cac9c43590e6505e95e34b97130dd44798260",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "a",
        "speaker": "A",
        "sourceStart": 3048,
        "sourceEnd": 3082,
        "text": "approve now, no conditions. Option",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "078e741a30fc93f45038a37168b066af7228078a48b44d1c611e599fc5e9d363",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "b",
        "speaker": "B",
        "sourceStart": 3086,
        "sourceEnd": 3242,
        "text": "postpone until the full test. Option C: approve with conditions—start design, but no construction until the test is acceptable. And we publish what we know.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "9ad56661944d083ea7a8cdb6c1086ac248d8054447da8c4d1e9e290a13424042",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 3251,
        "sourceEnd": 3421,
        "text": "I can support Option C. But I want the public note to say clearly that the early scan is not a full test. People might think 'low risk' means 'safe'. That's not the same.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "e5f272c53f67b37a14e2c35011183e0d9f8ae2d9fad8a91dfb117fa64b82b639",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 3429,
        "sourceEnd": 3537,
        "text": "Agreed. We'll say: 'The early scan suggests low risk, but it is not a full test. The full test will decide.'",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "c676e1ad6a7fdfa232e879bc6f1116f7b4cc48cc1b7e420575b232428b00969b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 3547,
        "sourceEnd": 3723,
        "text": "And one more thing: we should set a date to review the decision. If the test is delayed again, we don't want to wait forever. Let's say we review in four weeks, no matter what.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "cdc959edff98e93ff153b29b569bc8bc33abe8359e86062850e9e98c25576bcb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 3731,
        "sourceEnd": 3838,
        "text": "Good. So the motion is: approve Option C, with a public note and a review date in four weeks. All in favor?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "7a04720b26ec6adf88ac4e9ae5b54cfff06b41aea9ddb5cd471fe1368b2543b0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 3847,
        "sourceEnd": 3851,
        "text": "Yes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "5f9a2b795615ba6a3d5455fd5624d773fbca5bcd16249c421fd37411dc9837da",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 3861,
        "sourceEnd": 3865,
        "text": "Yes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "5f9a2b795615ba6a3d5455fd5624d773fbca5bcd16249c421fd37411dc9837da",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 3873,
        "sourceEnd": 4028,
        "text": "Then it's decided. Thank you both. And remember: we're deciding with incomplete evidence, but we're being honest about it. That's the best we can do today.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "0774ab56312a891c68a2b1290bb9655e71be0751b9aef17428188fc1452037d8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
